      "content": "but even those small moments feel like nothing. it's just a temporary break before the world hits you again. i just wonder if there's any point to all the struggle if the end result is always just more hiding. sometimes i feel like the only way to actually be at peace, to finally stop the fighting, is to just... not have to deal with any of it anymore. does that even make sense?",
